                                        "entry_id": "340d6036-d60e-31ae-b8e4-028ac52f0ae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A perennial woody plant taller and larger than a shrub with a wooden trunk and, at some distance from the ground, having leaves and branches."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2779f4b0-2507-406a-b9c6-4c307af81829",
                                                "sense_id": "67dedb9a-d08f-3729-85cb-33d84204f727",
                                                "text": "Hyperion is the tallest living tree in the world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0ad4e08-3da3-4071-bdc1-ea7284d2ce17",
                                                "sense_id": "67dedb9a-d08f-3729-85cb-33d84204f727",
                                                "text": "Birds have a nest in a tree in the garden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49a9f00b-dceb-4cd8-b81f-88848b1ea8c5",
                                                "sense_id": "67dedb9a-d08f-3729-85cb-33d84204f727",
                                                "text": "B. Wooster: Of all the places on this great planet of ours, West Neck, Long Island, has chosen to be the most unexciting. The last time anything remotely interesting happened here was in 1842, when a tree fell over. They still talk about it in the village."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d13b52d6-d887-4cf2-a8fe-60faf9ce1562",
                                                "sense_id": "67dedb9a-d08f-3729-85cb-33d84204f727",
                                                "text": "When we see a train trapped behind (or embedded in) a fallen tree our first thought should be 'what was it doing there anyway?' […]Trees are also responsible for numerous minor delays in autumn [due to leaves falling on the track], which rolling stock engineers are supposed to cope with as usual."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aacb31b9-9faa-3103-aa1d-6e6e998d2146",
                                        "entry_id": "340d6036-d60e-31ae-b8e4-028ac52f0ae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any other plant (such as a large shrub or herb) that is reminiscent of the above in form and size."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cc64f23-c5ce-4934-b716-16ec71f92d2f",
                                                "sense_id": "aacb31b9-9faa-3103-aa1d-6e6e998d2146",
                                                "text": "The banana tree is a tall perennial herb: its trunk is not woody."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "503419a7-e08e-34f5-b2b7-2ae2f74bdba5",
                                        "entry_id": "340d6036-d60e-31ae-b8e4-028ac52f0ae0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An object made from a tree trunk and having multiple hooks or storage platforms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b42b50e4-54b7-4568-9d1c-caaf7d63951a",
                                                "sense_id": "503419a7-e08e-34f5-b2b7-2ae2f74bdba5",
                                                "text": "He had the choice of buying a scratching post or a cat tree."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc765b99-3cff-3538-af55-1c908302f27a",
